        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_36344"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Baryon is a fermion that does experience the strong force (strong interaction). The term is derived from the Greek βαρυσ (heavy).</obo:IAO_0000115>
