        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://semanticscience.org/resource/CHEMINF_000091"/>
        <dcterms:description>The quality of an atom in which the 2s orbital mixes with only one of the three p-orbitals resulting in two sp orbitals and two remaining unchanged p orbitals. spsp overlap between two atoms form a s bond and two additional p bonds formed by pp overlap.</dcterms:description>
        <rdfs:label>sp hybridized</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


